ase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="md" data-d-weight="semibold">Siguiente paso: comprobar el formulario</h3><ol class="PSWZZq_List" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="number" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">En VS Code, abre <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">formulario.html</code>.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Presiona <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Ctrl + S</span> para guardar.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Ve al navegador donde tienes la página abierta.</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Presiona <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Ctrl + R</span> para actualizar.</p></div></div></li></ol><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Deberías ver <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">un solo menú de navegación y debajo el formulario</span> con estos campos:</p><ul class="PSWZZq_List" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Nombre</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Email</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Mensaje</p></div></div></li><li class="PSWZZq_Item" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="PSWZZq_Content"><div class="PSWZZq_Label" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Botón «Enviar mensaje»</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Dime qué pasó:</span> ¿ya ves el formulario debajo del menú o todavía te aparecen las dos barras? 😊</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Acciones de respuesta" class="touch:-me-2