" aria-pressed="false" class="pointer-events-auto z-11 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white h-10 gap-0 rounded-full bg-black/15 px-3 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-black/30 focus:bg-black/30" aria-label="Editar imagen">Editar</button></div><div class="pointer-events-auto flex gap-2" data-testid="image-gen-overlay-right-actions"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="pointer-events-auto z-11 flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium text-white group h-10 w-10" aria-label="Compartir esta imagen"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/15 backdrop-blur-md group-hover:bg-black/30 group-focus:bg-black/30"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon fill-current" style="filter: drop-shadow(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 2px 4px);"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bef2fe87.svg#8768d3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-message-id="c23258fa-7e9a-40ae-9c6b-537564baab3e" data-message-author-role="assistant" data-model-dil-v2-message=""><div><div data-dil-widget-copy-target="" data-dil-chart-clipboard-alt="Gráfico" class="puik-root not-prose not-markdown" data-theme="light"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute h-px w-px overflow-hidden opacity-0"></div><div dir="auto" class="fv0XaG_DilRenderer fv0XaG_DilResponseRoot J4E5kq_Reveal dil-first-visible-layout w-full max-w-full" data-d-inline-reveal="" data-d-direction="col"><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">¡Vayaa, vamos a hacer que el carrusel de ARLY se vea mucho más elegante! 💗✨ El problema es que tienes una ilustración SVG y dos imágenes externas que pueden verse diferentes entre sí.</p><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Vamos a conseguir un estilo de joyería fina: <span class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">imágenes rectangulares, tonos dorados, fondo elegante y las tres fotografías con el mismo tamaño</span>. No necesitas cambiar todo tu <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">index.html</code>; solo vamos a ajustar las imágenes y el CSS.</p><h2 class="w6asjq_TextBase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">1. Cambia el tamaño de las imágenes</h2><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Abre <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">css/style.css</code> y busca la parte que dice <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">.carousel img</code>.</p><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Reemplaza esa regla por esta:</p><div class="_8ljHja_chatgptPaletteBoundary" data-client-defined-widget="code_block" data-d-component="code_block"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-bef2fe87.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-