.</span><span class="ͼl">carousel</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">img</span><span> {
    display: </span><span class="ͼj">block</span><span>;
    width: </span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;
    height: </span><span class="ͼj">460</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    object-fit: </span><span class="ͼj">cover</span><span>;
    object-position: </span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">carousel</span><span> {
    border-radius: </span><span class="ͼj">18</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    overflow: </span><span class="ͼj">hidden</span><span>;
    background: </span><span class="ͼg">var</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼm">--surface-2</span><span>);
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">carousel-caption</span><span> {
    background: </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">35</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">18</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">0.72</span><span>);
    padding: </span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">rem</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">1.25</span><span class="ͼg">rem</span><span>;
    border-radius: </span><span class="ͼj">12</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼg">@media</span><span> (max-width: </span><span class="ͼj">767</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>) {
    .</span><span class="ͼl">carousel</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">img</span><span> {
        height: </span><span class="ͼj">300</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    }
}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Esto hace que las imágenes tengan el mismo tamaño y evita que se deformen.</p><h2 class="w6asjq_TextBase GgxHUa_Title" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold">2. Cambia las imágenes del <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">index.html</code></h2><p class="w6asjq_TextBase _85PZeG_Text" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Dentro de <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">carousel-inner</code>, cambia únicamente las tres etiquetas <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">&lt;img&gt;</code> por estas. Para que se vean bien, guarda las tres fotos en la carpeta <code class="er4J8W_Code" data-d-component="code">img</code>.</p><div class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-align="start" data-d-component="row" data-d-direction="row" style="gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);"><div class="oIb9lq_Box" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-border="" data-d-has-height="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 124px;"><div class="BjVYla_Image BjVYla_OverlayBox BjVYla_LoadingFrame group/search-image" data-d-component="image" data-d-host-hover="" style="border-radius: 0px; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;"><div class="BjVYla_HoverContent" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; transform: none;"><img alt="UK Gol